---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="What data Deals For Moms collects, why, and how affiliate and analytics cookies work.">
  <div class="wrap" style="padding-top:48px">
    <div class="prose">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated: September 2026.</em></p>
      <h2>What is collected</h2>
      <p>This site does not ask you to create an account and does not collect names or email addresses unless you send them to me directly.</p>
      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>Clicking an affiliate link redirects you through a tracking service that records the click — a hashed IP address, browser type, country, and the page you came from — so the retailer can attribute a sale. It does not identify you personally.</p>
      <h2>Retailer cookies</h2>
      <p>When you follow a link to a retailer, that retailer sets its own cookies. What they do with them is governed by their privacy notice, not this one.</p>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>Aggregate, cookie-free traffic analytics are used to see which pages are read. No cross-site tracking, no advertising pixels.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>To ask what is held about you or to have it deleted, get in touch via the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
